    oe:aboutDisease oed:osteoporosis ;
    oe:answerText "Zoledronate prevents fractures in older women when administered every 12 to 18 months, but its effects on bone density and bone turnover persist beyond 5 years. Whether infrequent zoledronate administration would prevent vertebral fractures in early postmenopausal women is unknown."^^xsd:string ;
